### =========================
### 🔐 AUTH FLOW (SIMPLU)
### =========================

### Register USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User Test",
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "USER"
}

###
POST https://employee-api-wnqq.onrender.com/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex.trainer@nexusfit.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

###

### Register TRAINER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trainer Test",
  "email": "trainer@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "TRAINER"
}

###

### Login USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.token); %}

###

### Login TRAINER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trainer@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("trainer_token", response.body.token); %}

### =========================
### 🧪 TEST SECURITY
### =========================

### No token (should fail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts

###

### USER token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}


### Complete user workout
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user-workouts/21/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}



###


GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

### TRAINER token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

### =========================
### 💪 WORKOUTS
### =========================

### Create workout (TRAINER only)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

{
  "name": "Push Day",
  "description": "Chest + Triceps"
}

###

### Get workouts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

### =========================
### 🧍 USER WORKOUTS
### =========================

### Assign workout to user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user-workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "userId": 7,
  "workoutId": 3,
  "date": "2026-04-01"
}

###

### Get user workouts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user-workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}


###
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user-workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}






### =========================
### 👤 PROFILE
### =========================

### Get profile
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Update profile name only
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "name": "User Updated"
}

###

### Login USER again after profile update
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.token); %}

###

### Change password
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "1234",
  "newPassword": "12345"
}

### Change password back to 1234
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/profile/password
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "currentPassword": "12345",
  "newPassword": "1234"
}

###

### Login USER with new password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "12345"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.token); %}

###

###

### Login USER again with original password
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("user_token", response.body.token); %}



### Get workout exercises
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts/9/exercises
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### Add exercise to workout
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts/9/exercises
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

{
  "name": "Lat Pulldown",
  "sets": 3,
  "reps": "8-10",
  "notes": "Progressive overload, controlled negative",
  "position": 1
}

###

### Add second exercise
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts/9/exercises
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

{
  "name": "Seated Row",
  "sets": 3,
  "reps": "10-12",
  "notes": "Keep chest stable, squeeze at the top",
  "position": 2
}

###

### Update exercise
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workout-exercises/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

{
  "name": "Lat Pulldown",
  "sets": 4,
  "reps": "8-10",
  "notes": "Progressive overload, full range of motion",
  "position": 1
}

###
###


### Delete exercise
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workout-exercises/1
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}